THE PLUGIN
----------
Derived from RaspberryJuice, a Bukkit plugin implementing the Minecraft Pi API:

    https://github.com/zhuowei/RaspberryJuice
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

RaspberryJuice in turn implements the API of Minecraft: Pi Edition, and follows
the shape of Mojang's mcpi. Contributions to the line reach FruitJuice through
several hands, notably MinecraftDawn's 2019 refactoring, which moved the
world, player and entity commands out of RemoteSession and into the CmdWorld,
CmdPlayer and CmdEntity classes they still live in.

FruitJuice is likewise Apache 2.0, so the licence is unchanged along the whole
chain. What changed is stated in the version history: multi-world support,
thread-safe queues, block facing, replies paired with the requests that asked
for them, and the rest.


