THE MINECRAFT PI API ITSELF
---------------------------
The protocol these all speak -- world.setBlock, player.getTile, and the rest --
originates with Mojang's Minecraft: Pi Edition and its Python library. Nothing
of Mojang's is included here; only the shape of the conversation is the same,
so that programs written for a Raspberry Pi in 2013 still run against a modern
server.
